<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, independent English-first proposal. GMR English and source Wylie are preserved verbatim; no alignment is promoted to hgm_gloss. The question about the nature is recast as do we describe; no defensible isolated noun nature/describe pair is asserted. This is distributed translation, not a null. GMR supplies the number/category framing from the surrounding classification; no local Tibetan numeral is invented. Topic/continuation and outer explanatory structure are distributed; the explicit inner causal exponents are assigned to their two pas particles. No extra outer causal atom is forced. English articles, pronouns and framing auxiliaries remain unwrapped; the explicit lexical definition copula is mapped only to represents. Source verse-number apparatus is retained verbatim without a translation pair.</div>
